      <div class="price-pill">A partir de R$ 109,90</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cake-card">
      <div class="cake-photo">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578985545062-69928b1d9587?w=500&h=500&fit=crop&q=80&auto=format" alt="Bolo Prestígio">
      </div>
      <h3>Bolo Prestígio</h3>
      <p class="desc">Massa de chocolate intenso com recheio cremoso de coco e cobertura de chocolate meio amargo.</p>
      <div class="cake-meta"><span>1 kg a 4 kg</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <span>Chocolate / Coco</span></div>
      <div class="price-pill">A partir de R$ 99,90</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cake-card">
      <div class="cake-photo">
