      <div class="price-pill">A partir de R$ 104,90</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cake-card">
      <div class="cake-photo">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606890737304-57a1ca8a5b62?w=500&h=500&fit=crop&q=80&auto=format" alt="Bolo Sensação">
      </div>
      <h3>Bolo Sensação</h3>
      <p class="desc">Massa de chocolate com recheio de morango e cobertura de brigadeiro de chocolate.</p>
      <div class="cake-meta"><span>1 kg a 4 kg</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <span>Chocolate / Morango</span></div>
      <div class="price-pill">A partir de R$ 109,90</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cake-card">
      <div class="cake-photo">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1602351447937-745cb720612f?w=500&h=500&fit=crop&q=80&auto=format" alt="Bolo Ninho com Nutella">
      </div>
      <h3>Bolo Ninho com Nutella</h3>
      <p class="desc">Massa branca leve, recheio cremoso de Ninho e generosa cobertura de Nutella.</p>
      <div class="cake-meta"><span>1 kg a 4 kg</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <span>Ninho / Nutella</span></div>
      <div class="price-pill">A partir de R$ 119,90</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cake-card">
      <div class="cake-photo">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572897305697-f8adb93dae8f?w=500&h=500&fit=crop&q=80&auto=format" alt="Bolo Churros">
      </div>
      <h3>Bolo Churros</h3>
      <p class="desc">Massa branca com recheio de doce de leite e finalização com canela e açúcar.</p>
      <div class="cake-meta"><span>1 kg a 4 kg</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <span>Doce de leite / Canela</span></div>
      <div class="price-pill">A partir de R$ 99,90</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cake-card">
      <div class="cake-photo">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1635117492718-695a17a5977a?w=500&h=500&fit=crop&q=80&auto=format" alt="Bolo Red Velvet">
