      <div class="price-pill">A partir de R$ 129,90</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cake-card">
      <div class="cake-photo">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569929232526-d9c6578e1531?w=500&h=500&fit=crop&q=80&auto=format" alt="Bolo Ouro Branco">
      </div>
      <h3>Bolo Ouro Branco</h3>
      <p class="desc">Massa de chocolate com creme branco e finalização com raspas de chocolate Ouro Branco.</p>
      <div class="cake-meta"><span>1 kg a 4 kg</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <span>Chocolate / Ouro Branco</span></div>
      <div class="price-pill">A partir de R$ 119,90</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cake-card">
      <div class="cake-photo">
        <span class="badge">SOB MEDIDA</span>
